      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>A pizmon for calling up a (male) Jew-by-choice for his first aliyah to the Torah after completing his conversion process. (Pizmonim for female and non-binary Jews-by-choice forthcoming!) To be recited before the blessing, led by the gabbai with the community responding with the refrain.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
